# Terraform's working directory. infrastructure/.gitignore says this too, for
# whoever reads that directory on its own — but it has to be here as well:
# prettier takes its ignore list from the root .gitignore only, and `npm run
# format:check` walks into an un-ignored .terraform/ and chokes on a 700 MB
# provider binary.
.terraform/

# Working notes for whoever is actively building the thing — a scratchpad for
# one person's session, not a description of the product. What an adopting
# team needs is in the CLAUDE.md files and docs/, which are checked in.
docs/PROJECT_STATUS.md

# browser-review screenshots (MCP)
.playwright-mcp/
